KEYSTROKES:
# Whole-year print for 2026 (per the User Instructions above: key month,
# A; key year, R/S; press C for balance of year — starting at month 1
# (January) prints the whole year). Data entry (keying month/year) is
# left at regular speed and outside the elapsed-time measurement; only
# the print itself (triggered by C) is timed, and run at full speed.
